                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Qwvb2",
                  "name": "Rationale",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Persona hues identify which agent is which (AgentMark body, split-mode cursor + label, session dot). They never carry status: success / warning / danger are unchanged and always paired with an icon or text. Ember (20°, bright) is kept apart from warning (36°, ochre); Moss (88°, olive, muted) from success (137°, saturated). Lead agent = Teal; spawned agents take Iris → Violet → Rose → Ember → Moss. See board 24.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
