                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Decision needed — personas extend the agent colour system. Today “teal = agent” is a single semantic (one $agent / $agent-2 / $agent-soft triple). Parallel agents would need per-persona triples ($agent-iris, $agent-iris-2, $agent-iris-soft …) in light + dark, a rule for which persona an agent gets (stable per host? per session?), and a check that canvas selection, presence cursors, placeholder tags and diff highlights stay teal-only or follow the persona. Recommend deciding the count (4 vs 6) before building.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
