                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "2. Each spawned / additional agent takes the next free hue in order Iris → Violet → Rose → Ember → Moss. A hue is held for the life of the session and released on disconnect; reconnects within 10 min get their old hue back.",
