                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Pane 'about' (menu.rs ABOUT → settings_pane_for). Identity row (app icon, version + build + platform/arch in mono, licence), Copy version info (the string Report issue uses) + Check for updates…. Four outbound links open in the default browser. Licenses: filterable list generated at build time from bun.lock + Cargo.lock + bundled fonts; a row opens the licence text in a sheet.",
