                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "macOS: native Help menu (menu.rs gains a Help submenu; macOS adds the Search field itself). Windows / Linux / web: the same items as a 'Help' submenu at the bottom of the in-app File menu (board 20 AsXP1). Documentation + What's new open the browser; Report an issue opens a prefilled GitHub issue (version, OS, renderer — never file content) after a confirm; Copy diagnostics copies the same block. Logs: desktop only.",
