              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1312,
              "content": "The public face of Kimo v1.0: kimo.design landing (desktop 1440 + mobile 390), the docs site (article, format-spec and CLI-reference layouts, desktop + mobile), and the small brand assets (app icon, OG image, README banner). Same monochrome system as the editor — ink on warm greys, pill controls, big flat cards, Inter + JetBrains Mono — with colour only where it means something (agent teal + AgentMark personas, selection blue, status). Product imagery is copied from the real editor boards, never mocked. Copy is honest: no testimonials, metrics, customer logos or star counts.",
