                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Strongly camera-coded (photo apps, lens brands). Hexagonal six-fold symmetry is shared with the interlaced-knot family — separated by straight seams, a solid disc and no interlace.",
