                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Four editor panels (layers, canvas, properties, agent) folding into one workspace. Square, so it stands apart from round AI marks; the sturdiest at 16 px.",
