                          "name": "Risk",
                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The least 'rosette' of the six. Arms must stay straight and never bend, to avoid unwanted symbol readings. Windmill tilings exist in other brands' marks.",
