                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Gear, bolt-hole and piping-tip readings, and the most meme-prone of the six. Nearest neighbour: the solid disc of the letter-in-circle family — no letter here, but the disc is shared.",
