              "content": "Code: the same mark appears in packages/ui (topbar Logo, Home brand), apps/desktop About pane and the Tauri icon set (apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons). Search criterion used: every frame whose child text is exactly 'k' (16 hits outside this board) plus app-icon specimens. Copies of editor boards inside this board were updated to KimoLogo directly.",
