                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ZhuBF",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "PageRow is quieter than LayerRow on purpose: no disclosure, no type icon, a check for the current page (Figma/Sketch convention) and an optional mono layer count. PaletteRow is the ⌘P switcher row (Active shows the ↵ key). DropIndicator: Between = 2 px $selection line with a hollow 8 px ring at the target indent; Invalid = the same in $danger (+ not-allowed cursor). LayerRow/DropTarget = the 'into' state: 1.5 px $selection outline + $selection-soft + corner-down-right glyph. InsertionBar is the canvas twin for auto layout (2 px bar, 6 px end caps, always $selection). PropField/Bindable shows the 'variable' bind button on hover; PropField/Bound swaps the value for a variable chip, resolved value trailing in mono, Detach (unlink) on hover.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": "$text-xs",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
