                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Pointer in the top/bottom quarter of a row = Between (indent follows the pointer's x, so you can drop a level up at the end of a group); middle half of a frame/group row = Into (row outlined, auto-expands after 600 ms hover). Invalid targets — inside an instance, into a non-container, a node into its own descendant — draw the line in $danger, show a not-allowed cursor and a tooltip; release = no-op. Multi-select drags as one block; one undo step.",
