                      "id": "NvWNw",
                      "name": "Decision",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Dragging a child inside its auto-layout parent reorders it (siblings slide, the vacated slot stays as an outline until release). Once the pointer leaves the parent's bounds the slot collapses and the node reparents to whatever is under the pointer — another auto-layout frame (InsertionBar), a free frame, or the canvas. Holding ⌘ while dragging keeps it in the same parent but absolute.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                      "fontSize": "$text-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
