                      "content": "The enum target is no longer fixed to opacity. Each option (sm · md · lg tabs) owns a list of targets: Layer (any descendant of the main, by id) × Property (filtered to what that layer supports: size, padding, gap, radius, opacity, fill, font size/weight, visibility, icon…) × Value (literal or bound variable). Picking an option on an instance applies all its targets; unset props fall back to the main's values.",
