                      "content": "The preview pane gains Preview | Issues tabs; the Issues tab carries a count chip ($warning-soft, $danger-soft when any error) and opens automatically when the dry run finds an error. Issues are grouped per output file, each with level icon, message and a node chip — clicking it closes the dialog and selects the node. Tailwind theme sits under the React + Tailwind format: '@theme in globals.css (v4)' · 'tailwind.config.ts (v3)' · 'Don't emit', plus Map variables to theme tokens.",
