                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The Code tab has no Tailwind control: like the token scope, the theme lives in Export (board 27 §10 f6LWt) and the tab reads the same remembered choice — Tailwind theme and Map variables to theme tokens — so its files match what Export writes. Only the file tabs change (tailwind.config.ts appears for v3); classes switch to raw values when mapping is off or the theme is not emitted. Changing it in Export regenerates the open Code tab.",
